values ('c5d6e7f8-9a0b-4c80-9d00-1e2f3a4b5c10', 'advanced-grammar-and-composition', 'Advanced Grammar and Composition', 'Advanced Grammar and Composition develops precise, flexible, and stylistically mature Spanish for upper-division academic work. Students analyze complex grammar in context, revise essays through multiple drafts, and learn to consult authoritative grammar and usage references. The course treats grammar as a writing resource: every structure is linked to clearer argument, stronger paragraph cohesion, and more idiomatic Spanish.');

